bluejetty:00122986:ios.description:
Receiving information about active insurance policies, reporting and managing claims or getting reimbursement has never been so easy. GPI Holding offers you the easiest, quickest and the most convenient way to manage your and your family members' insurance policies, report an auto insurance claim and get the assistance in case of an incident or apply and get the reimbursement for the medical services covered by your health insurance.
Mobile service is absolutely free and has no commission charges!
We constantly think to make insurance services more comfortable and avallable for you.
Download the app, register or authorize with your user and password, enter your personal account and get started. In order to receive user and password for your personal account, you have to register on the web page mygpi.ge or in in mobile application.
Features:
Insurance policies:
•⁠ ⁠Active policies and personal profile;
•⁠ ⁠Policy details;
•⁠ ⁠Payment graph & payment of insurance premium;
•⁠ ⁠Health insurance card; Health insurance plan;
•⁠ ⁠Appeals and claims' history;
•⁠ ⁠Doctors' appointments
Health Insurance:
•⁠ ⁠Apply for reimbursement;
•⁠ ⁠Take and send the photos of your medical and financial documentation or attach the existing documentation to the application;
•⁠ ⁠Contact GP Holding Service Manager and if needed get the detailed instructions about next steps;
•⁠ ⁠Send your bank account number and get reimbursement in one business day.
Auto Insurance:
•⁠ ⁠Report a claim;
•⁠ ⁠Take and send the photos of your car after incident;
•⁠ ⁠Contact GP| Holding claims representative;
•⁠ ⁠Get detailed instructions about next steps;
•⁠ ⁠Incident location using the GPS tracker;
•⁠ ⁠Send your bank account number and get reimbursement.
Loyalty points – Ecoins
Ecoins are accumulated from paid premium or collected doing particular eco activities, like walking 10000 steps or drinking 2 liters of water per day.
The application integrates with Health app via Healthkit in order to collect data about users activities.
Ecoins can be used to purchase a new insurance policy or for the payment of monthly premium.
NOTE:
•⁠ ⁠The application is only for GPIH Insurance Policyholders;
•⁠ ⁠You will be able to access the application and report a claim or apply for reimbursement only if your policy is active at the moment;
•⁠ ⁠Please note that you only will be able to report a claim or send the application if your phone or tablet is connected to the internet.

